     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-5-broken-oaths#:~:text=%22Syr%20Rowan%20knocked%20us%20both%20out."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Will's knights burst into Ardenvale, Rowan and Will confront each other, and Ashiok returns and takes control of the sleepers until Kellan lashes Ashiok in place so Will can strike them with a bolt of ice, which makes Ashiok vanish.",
    "cites": [
